{
  "name": "Draf balasan email otomatis (Gmail)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Draf balasan email otomatis\nSetiap 5 menit membaca email baru yang belum dibaca, lalu AI menulis **draf** balasan di thread yang sama. Tidak ada email yang terkirim otomatis: kamu cek dan kirim sendiri dari Gmail.\n\n1. Buat credential **Gmail OAuth2** dan **OpenAI** (Base URL penyedia + API key).\n2. Ganti info bisnis di node **Tulis draf** (System message).\n3. Aktifkan workflow.\n\nEmail promosi, newsletter, dan notifikasi otomatis dijawab `SKIP` oleh AI dan dilewati.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "609ea4d0-dac9-553d-babf-6ea4a6d81103",
      "name": "Catatan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "-from:me -category:promotions -category:social",
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4045cefa-028d-54f0-b08d-e40ed4b86848",
      "name": "Email masuk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Dari: {{ $json.from.text }}\nSubjek: {{ $json.subject }}\n\n{{ ($json.text || '').slice(0, 8000) }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Kamu membantu admin Toko Contoh membalas email pelanggan.\n\nAturan:\n- Kalau email ini promosi, newsletter, notifikasi otomatis, atau spam, balas persis: SKIP\n- Selain itu, tulis draf balasan dalam bahasa yang sama dengan email, sopan, maksimal 120 kata, tanpa baris subjek.\n- Jangan menjanjikan harga, refund, atau tanggal kirim. Kalau perlu data yang tidak kamu punya, tulis [ISI: ...] supaya admin melengkapinya.\n- Tutup dengan: Salam, Tim Toko Contoh\n\nInfo bisnis (ganti): jam kerja Senin-Jumat 09.00-17.00 WIB, pesanan dikirim 1x24 jam kerja."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "acd8f11e-6fbc-59de-ba71-17a9f2741025",
      "name": "Tulis draf",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "deepseek-v4.1-flash",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 500,
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "06d58b77-dadb-5cf9-a7a4-76af6ec399d8",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "AI API (OpenAI-compatible)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "2d8df853-ca0e-51ce-9c03-fdb66ac96420",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.text || '').trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "SKIP",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notStartsWith"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "49a85baf-2ecd-5947-8960-8be4f3e80ffa",
      "name": "Perlu dibalas?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "operation": "create",
        "subject": "=Re: {{ $('Email masuk').item.json.subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "threadId": "={{ $('Email masuk').item.json.threadId }}",
          "sendTo": "={{ $('Email masuk').item.json.from.value[0].address }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "28b282ba-634e-5f72-a465-abd94367841f",
      "name": "Buat draf Gmail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -20
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
